STO 56
XEQ 66                          ; -> :TRANS:
STO 53
RCL 63
STO 56
RCL 64
STO 58
XEQ 66                          ; -> :TRANS:
STO 54
@ north (start < end): on from the start to the end; south (the end first): on from the start, or
@ before the end
RCL 53
RCL 54
X>Y?
IF 01
  RCL 53
  RCL 57
  X≥Y?
  IF 02
    RCL 54
    RCL 57
    X<Y?
    XEQ 65                      ; -> :DSTON:
  ENDIF 02
ELSE 01
  RCL 53
  RCL 57
  X≥Y?
  XEQ 65                        ; -> :DSTON:
  RCL 54
  RCL 57
  X<Y?
  XEQ 65                        ; -> :DSTON:
ENDIF 01
RTN
@ LBL :DSTON: DST on: R59 = R28 + R49
LBL 65                          ; :DSTON:
RCL 49
RCL 28
+
STO 59
RTN
